  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往斯特隆海姆城（45.33）进入资料库，与民俗学者八云松（23.11）对话，获得【调查笔记】。",
      "type": "step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◇提醒：本任务为支线。若去矿山小镇烧技能，可以跳过本任务，完成新村6即可。",
      "type": "route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.傍晚、夜晚期间，持有【调查笔记】时与斯特隆海姆城（22.42）处悠闲的渔夫对话，进入海岛秘境。",
      "type": "time-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.与水蜘蛛（28.55）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆BOSS战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "水蜘蛛，Lv.45*4，血量约800，技能：攻击、防御、混乱攻击、冰雹魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆水蜘蛛刷声望：",
      "type": "reputation-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "备注1：若只想打水蜘蛛刷声望，则做到此步即可。",
      "type": "optional-stop-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "备注2：战斗胜利后向前走一步之后再退回一步即可回到水蜘蛛面前。",
      "type": "repeat-route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "备注3：对应声望的数值参考文章 《怀旧服刷声望方法》。",
      "type": "article-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "备注4：完成过本任务后，亦可获得【调查笔记】接到任务可以刷水蜘蛛。",
      "type": "repeat-acquisition-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "4.战斗胜利后与乌龟贤者（34.36）对话，获得【公主的求助信】。通过（29.28）处传送石，进入海底隧道。",
      "type": "step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆海底隧道为随机迷宫，约6层；魔物为Lv.39~44铁钳螃蟹、史莱姆",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "5.通过随机迷宫抵达螃蟹将军的领地，与铁蟹将军（26.11）对话，交出【公主求助信】获得【军情信】，并传送出迷宫。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "6.与乌龟贤者（34.36）对话，交出【军情信】获得【龟贤者的信物】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "7.返回斯特隆海姆城资料室与民俗学者八云松对话。",
      "type": "step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "8.前往西尔维村与豪爽的渔夫对话（56.60），交出【龟贤者的信物】获得【碧水珠】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "9.返回斯特隆海姆城，黄昏至夜晚期间与悠闲的渔夫（22.42）对话，进入海盗秘境。",
      "type": "time-gate-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "10.与水蜘蛛（28.55）对话，进入战斗。战斗胜利后与乌龟贤者（69.13）对话，进入宫殿？。",
      "type": "battle-route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "11.与三头海邪龙对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "Lv.50蛟龙，血量约10000；技能：攻击、防御、强力冰冻魔法、石化攻击、诸刃",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "Lv.45水蜘蛛*4，血量约900；技能：攻击、防御、连击",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "12.战斗胜利后与乌龟贤者对话，交出【调查笔记】、【碧水珠】获得【海族谢礼】、【给渔夫的谢礼】。",
      "type": "grouped-exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "13.返回斯特隆海姆城资料库（45.33）与民俗学者八云松（23.11）对话，交出【海族的谢礼】获得【避水珠】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "◆避水珠：Lv.4；护身符；不可交易；耐久100；必杀+8、命中+15；数值浮动",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆持有【避水珠】时，可前往海岛秘境的无极漩涡捕捉Lv.1巨鳌螃蟹",
      "type": "item-unlock",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "◆无极漩涡抵达方法：前往海岛秘境，战胜水蜘蛛后与乌龟辅佐官（46.24）对话可通过栅栏进入黄色传送石",
      "type": "route-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆无极漩涡为随机迷宫，约5层；魔物为Lv.48~55铁剪螃蟹、水蜘蛛、巨鳌螃蟹",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "◆通过无极漩涡迷宫底层传送石可至无极漩涡最底层，此处可捕捉Lv.1巨鳌螃蟹；通过上楼楼梯口可离开迷宫",
      "type": "capture-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "14.返回西尔维村与豪爽的渔夫对话，交出【给渔夫的谢礼】获得【蛋包饭】，任务完结。",
      "type": "exchange-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
